<title>MAURITANIA: Mauritania changes defence minister.</title>
<headline>Mauritania changes defence minister.</headline>
<dateline>NOUAKCHOTT 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mauritanian President Maaouya Ould Sid'Ahmed Taya moved Defence Minister Mohamed Ould Amar to the planning ministry in a technical cabinet shuffle affecting four other portfolios, an official statement said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The new defence minister is Ahmed Yeslim Ould Vil, who moves over from the ministry of water and energy.</p>
</text>
